  "solution": "Mặt phẳng <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>:</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></semantics></math> có véc-tơ pháp tuyến là <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mover><mi>n</mi><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mi>P</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math>.\n\t\tMặt cầu <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>S</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math> có tâm <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>3</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math>. Đường thẳng <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mi>d</mi></semantics></math> đi qua <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mi>I</mi></semantics></math> và vuông góc với <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math> nên nhận <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><msub><mover><mi>n</mi><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mi>P</mi></msub></semantics></math> làm véc-tơ chỉ phương.<br>\n\t\tPhương trình tham số của <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"i